  "version": 1,
  "purpose": "Word pool for generating daily sets. Not the hand-made sets in index.html, which the free-play game keeps using.",
  "rules": {
    "wordsPerSet": 20,
    "familiesPerSet": 2,
    "wordsPerFamily": 10,
    "noRepeatWithinDays": 14,
    "note": "A set is ten words from one family and ten from another. The two families must be easy to tell apart, so a player feels they have ruled out half the grid; the difficulty lives inside a family, where the shapes collide.",
    "why14": "A family comes round every 7 days, so a window of 8 to 14 days all cost the same: two fresh batches, 20 words per family. 14 is the top of that band. The next step up is 21, not 15 -- 15 through 21 all cost three batches, 30 words per family, so 15 would pay the full price of 21 and take six fewer days."
